<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw over the county database of
scale-county-timeagg-year (setup-timeagg.sql), NOT aggregated: July 2020, the
weekday, one hour (7), road types 1 and 4, for the gasoline passenger car (21)
and the diesel combination long-haul truck (62); output Hour. It selects the
START-EXHAUST species moves.esm had not checked at any aggregation: N2O (the
opModeID 100 rate StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator weights at 1), CO2
Equivalent, the six ATRatio air toxics whose start generalFuelRatioExpression
strings FuelEffectsGenerator evaluates (benzene, ethanol, 1,3-butadiene,
formaldehyde, acetaldehyde, acrolein), the hydrocarbon parents they chain off
(THC, CH4, NMHC, NMOG, TOG, VOC), energy and CO2, and the start PM species
(PM10, PM2.5, OC, EC, sulfate, non-EC PM, aerosol water). Start exhaust only.]]></description>
